Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:15.88,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分 她们打了{\fs78}31{\fs68}分钟还没打完
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:18.81,TL,,0,0,0,,这已经是网球最快的决胜方式了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.81,0:00:20.31,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七被发明出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:22.86,TL,,0,0,0,,就是为了让比赛赶紧结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:26.22,TL,,0,0,0,,发明它的人叫吉米 范 阿伦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.71,TL,,0,0,0,,美国人 网球名人堂就是他创办的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:31.22,TL,,0,0,0,,这个人有个执念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:33.98,TL,,0,0,0,,网球什么都好 就是打不完
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.77,TL,,0,0,0,,一场势均力敌的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.41,TL,,0,0,0,,能从下午打到天黑 第二天接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:41.26,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}1969{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.84,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}41{\fs68}岁的冈萨雷斯和帕萨雷尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:46.66,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}打了一场{\fs78}112{\fs68}局的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:50.05,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}小时{\fs78}12{\fs68}分 跨了两天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:51.59,TL,,0,0,0,,还没分出胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:54.17,TL,,0,0,0,,所有人都看明白了 这么打下去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:57.85,TL,,0,0,0,,电视别排期了 球员先累死在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.19,0:01:00.48,TL,,0,0,0,,范 阿伦拿出了他的方案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:02.64,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1965{\fs68}年 他自掏腰包
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:05.33,TL,,0,0,0,,在纽波特办了场试验赛 请拉沃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.33,0:01:08.05,TL,,0,0,0,,罗斯维尔这些大牌来试新计分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:10.37,TL,,0,0,0,,可他没想到 真正救网球的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:13.10,TL,,0,0,0,,是他最看不上的那个版本
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:15.74,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}他力推的版本叫突然死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:18.58,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}其实就是今天抢七的骨架
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:20.73,TL,,0,0,0,,局分{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.73,0:01:22.21,TL,,0,0,0,,不再一局一局打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.21,0:01:24.23,TL,,0,0,0,,改打一个小局定胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.81,TL,,0,0,0,,小局里先到五分就赢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:29.83,TL,,0,0,0,,最狠的一条是 打到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:31.29,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一分定生死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:34.07,TL,,0,0,0,,接发球的人还能选从哪边接
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:34.94,TL,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:37.01,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分可能是发球方的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:40.43,TL,,0,0,0,,也可能是接发方的赛点 双赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.84,TL,,0,0,0,,球员和观众都爱这个版本
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.59,TL,,0,0,0,,够狠 够快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.59,0:01:46.79,TL,,0,0,0,,可拉沃他们几个大牌偏说不行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.33,TL,,0,0,0,,赢两分才算赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:50.03,TL,,0,0,0,,这是网球的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:51.52,TL,,0,0,0,,于是有了第二个版本
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.84,TL,,0,0,0,,先到七分 领先两分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:55.17,TL,,0,0,0,,范 阿伦气坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:57.88,TL,,0,0,0,,给它起名叫久拖之死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:01.15,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛在两个版本之间摇摆了几年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.15,0:02:04.03,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1970{\fs68}年美网第一次用上抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:06.21,TL,,0,0,0,,升起红旗 全场就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:08.20,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜负的时候到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:10.78,TL,,0,0,0,,赛事总监塔尔伯特把话说透了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:13.72,TL,,0,0,0,,球员不买票 买票的是观众
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.46,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}年后的{\fs78}1980{\fs68}年温网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.23,TL,,0,0,0,,博格对麦肯罗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.23,0:02:21.47,TL,,0,0,0,,第四盘抢七 网球史上最著名的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:24.47,TL,,0,0,0,,博格先拿到冠军点 麦肯罗救了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:27.74,TL,,0,0,0,,麦肯罗拿到盘点 博格又顶住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just, just out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就出界了一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:35.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And of course it's set point number seven for McEnroe.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N麦肯罗的第七个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:37.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quiet please.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N请安静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:39.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quiet please.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N请安静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:44.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yes — two sets all!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了 两盘打平！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.84,0:02:47.54,TL,,0,0,0,,你数一下 麦肯罗在这一个抢七里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:49.02,TL,,0,0,0,,救了{\fs78}5{\fs68}个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.74,TL,,0,0,0,,自己浪费了{\fs78}7{\fs68}个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:52.89,TL,,0,0,0,,最后{\fs78}18{\fs68}比{\fs78}16{\fs68}拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:56.06,TL,,0,0,0,,整个抢七打了{\fs78}20{\fs68}分钟 全场起立
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:58.76,TL,,0,0,0,,可博格第五盘还是{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.49,TL,,0,0,0,,五连冠到手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.68,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七治好了拖延症
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:05.51,TL,,0,0,0,,可它治不了一个地方 决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.51,0:03:06.85,TL,,0,0,0,,很长一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:09.37,TL,,0,0,0,,四大满贯的决胜盘不设抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.37,0:03:11.07,TL,,0,0,0,,必须领先两局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:12.72,TL,,0,0,0,,一场球最极端的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.51,TL,,0,0,0,,出现在{\fs78}2010{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.95,TL,,0,0,0,,伊斯内尔对马胡特
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:18.88,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘打到{\fs78}70{\fs68}比{\fs78}68{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:26.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you, thank you. 30, 40.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢 谢谢 三十比四十
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:33.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How will he cope with the enormity of this situation?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他要怎么扛住这一刻？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:39.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How will he cope with the enormity of this situation?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他要怎么扛住这一刻？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:44.93,TL,,0,0,0,,记分牌被打到没法显示
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:47.25,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人最后是站着合影的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:50.71,TL,,0,0,0,,整场{\fs78}11{\fs68}个小时{\fs78}5{\fs68}分钟 跨了{\fs78}3{\fs68}天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Lefty, it's in!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N左手回球 进了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:57.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's in!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N确实进了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:04.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We've seen it all!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场面 真是见所未见！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:07.76,TL,,0,0,0,,这之后 规矩终于改了 {\fs78}2019{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:10.31,TL,,0,0,0,,温网启用决胜盘{\fs78}12{\fs68}平抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:11.54,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网走得更远
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:14.32,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘六平之后直接抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:16.69,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年 四大满贯统一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:18.46,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘打到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:20.94,TL,,0,0,0,,抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}定胜负 领先两分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:24.62,TL,,0,0,0,,打不完的比赛 从规则上被判了死刑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:26.63,TL,,0,0,0,,而抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}最有名的一场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:28.34,TL,,0,0,0,,就是开头那场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:29.88,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.89,TL,,0,0,0,,布林科娃对莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:34.51,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}打到{\fs78}22{\fs68}比{\fs78}20{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:35.96,TL,,0,0,0,,她错过{\fs78}9{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.62,TL,,0,0,0,,又救了{\fs78}6{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:39.92,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}42{\fs68}分 三分钟 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:42.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}31{\fs68}分钟 才决出胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:57.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The grit, the will of Anna Blinkova is really something else.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布林科娃的这股韧劲和意志\N真是太特别了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:05:04.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Elena Rybakina equals her in just that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而莱巴金娜在这一点上 丝毫不输
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:10.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And is now the longest ever women's singles tiebreak at a Grand Slam event.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是大满贯史上最长的女单抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:14.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This day, I will remember for the rest of my life,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一天 我会铭记一生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's the best day of my life so far.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是我迄今最美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.10,TL,,0,0,0,,抢{\fs78}73{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:21.11,TL,,0,0,0,,从红旗升起的突然死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:23.17,TL,,0,0,0,,到{\fs78}22{\fs68}比{\fs78}20{\fs68}的抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:24.69,TL,,0,0,0,,它救了网球的排期
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:26.58,TL,,0,0,0,,没救得了网球的争论
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:29.13,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘抢{\fs78}10{\fs68} 你觉得是进步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:32.17,TL,,0,0,0,,还是网球丢掉了它最后的浪漫？
